OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FOut-of-control wildfires sweeping
OL,8,Fwestern Canada have been compared to a
OL,9,Fbomb going off, ITV News' Ciaran
OL,10,FFitzpatrick reports
OL,12,FA state of emergency has been declared
OL,13,Fin the western Canadian province of
OL,14,FBritish Columbia after a fast-moving
OL,15,Fwildfire destroyed homes and forced
OL,16,Fmore than 20,000 people to flee.
OL,18,FMore than 100 wildfires have been
OL,19,Fburning across the province, nearly
OL,20,Fhalf of them out of control in hot,
OL,21,Fwindy weather and a prolonged drought.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
