FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786330073
OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FThousands fled on jammed roads as
OL,8,Fofficials warned that "explosive"
OL,9,Fconditions could threaten more
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,FSummerland, home to about 12,000
OL,13,Fpeople, was ordered evacuated
OL,14,Fovernight, along with about 8,000
OL,15,Fpeople in and around nearby Peachland.
OL,26,@pD@WOUpD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786330073
OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FThe office of British Columbia's
OL,8,FPremier David Eby confirmed
OL,9,F"significant structure loss" but said
OL,10,Fofficials could not yet assess the
OL,11,Fdamage because the area remained an
OL,12,Factive fire zone.
OL,14,FEven emergency officials have been
OL,15,Fforced to flee by the speed of the
OL,16,Ffire, including Erick Thompson, who
OL,17,Fsaid he had to abandon his area's
OL,18,Femergency operations centre and
OL,19,Fevacuate his family.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
