OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,F"I had to leave the EOC to come and
OL,8,Fget my family to leave this area.
OL,9,FWe're heading south," he said in a
OL,10,Fvideo posted early Saturday from his
OL,11,Fvehicle as traffic backed up around
OL,12,Fhim.
OL,14,FThe Royal Canadian Mounted Police said
OL,15,Fthey are investigating a possible
OL,16,Fwildfire death near the district of
OL,17,FSummerland, but hazardous conditions
OL,18,Fhave prevented authorities from
OL,19,Fconfirming the fatality.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
