OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1786330073
OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FSome residents were trapped as the
OL,8,Ffire advanced, Eby said, while search-
OL,9,Fand-rescue crews continued looking for
OL,10,Fothers who may have been caught.
OL,12,FBritish Columbia Forests Minister Ravi
OL,13,FParmar said 18 firefighting aircraft
OL,14,Frescued more than 50 people.
OL,16,F"People have lost their homes. And
OL,17,Fmany people have been displaced," Eby
OL,18,Fsaid, calling the blaze's sudden
OL,19,Fgrowth "a remarkable escalation in
OL,20,Ffire activity".
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@aO]{D@HOU|D@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
