OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FHe said the fire became so intense
OL,8,Fthat it generated its own weather
OL,9,Fsystem and lightning.
OL,11,FCliff Chapman, the British Columbia
OL,12,FWildfire Service's director of
OL,13,Foperations, called conditions
OL,14,F"explosive" and warned that other
OL,15,Fcommunities could face similarly fast-
OL,16,Fmoving fires.
OL,26,@vD@AOUvD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
