OL,3,CWildfires in Canada force 20,000
OL,4,Cpeople to flee as state of emergency
OL,5,Cdeclared
OL,7,FThe state of emergency declared in
OL,8,FBritish Columbia gives the province
OL,9,Fadditional powers, including the
OL,10,Fability to restrict travel and secure
OL,11,Faccommodations for evacuees that might
OL,12,Fotherwise be unavailable.
OL,14,FCanada has endured increasingly
OL,15,Fdestructive wildfire seasons in recent
OL,16,Fyears, forcing mass evacuations and
OL,17,Frepeatedly sending smoke across large
OL,18,Fparts of Canada and the United States.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
